"Plinius asks for it on the lock screen. Choose 4 to 12 digits and keep it in "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"Plinius prosi o niego na ekranie blokady. Wybierz od 4 do 12 cyfr i dobrze "
"go zapamiętaj."

#: plinius-boot:8428
msgid "Repeat PIN"
